lp you send smarter, and personalised offers as a thank you for your loyalty with us. Simply update your <!--]--><!--]--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><a href="/customer/account/settings" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank"><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->contact preferences<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->to sign up for our email marketing.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div></div><div class="link-block__item" data-v-90dc4169 data-v-805cf62b><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6Xp2pbqstJ9-Wbq_EVRI_LOCATION_01_09878a65.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6Xp2pbqstJ9-Wbq_EVRI_LOCATION_01_0987.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6Xp2pbqstJ9-Wbq_EVRI_LOCATION_01_0987.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6Xp2pbqstJ9-Wbq_EVRI_LOCATION_01_0987.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="A customer sitting in a wheelchair is outside their house and accepting their parcel from the courier. The customer is in full view with a side profile of the courier." width="1000" height="667" class="link-block__image" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-805cf62b><div class="link-block__text-container" data-v-805cf62b><h3 class="link-block__card-title" data-v-805cf62b><!----> Set your delivery preferences</h3><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Tell us a <!--]--><!--]--><a href="/guides/safe-place" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank"><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->safe place<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> for your parcels, choose a preferred neighbour, and share accessibility instructions - like