u book your parcel online, find your nearest ParcelShop with a print-in-store device. You can scan your code on arrival, and your label prints right away.",[],{"dimensions":417,"alt":418,"copyright":33,"url":419,"id":420,"edit":421},{"width":174,"height":174},"Print in store icon","standard-account.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F7d9d4ed2-0193-4575-b0ea-dd0c7445e462_print+in-store+machine.svg","Yh96FxIAACkA-ZsM",{"x":44,"y":44,"zoom":45,"background":65},{"link_type":30,"key":388,"url":423},"\u002Ffind-a-parcelshop","Find a ParcelShop",{"sectionTitle":426,"sectionDescription":33,"linksStyle":394},"Printer and label settings","feature_link_cards_promo$1fc7247a-c8c1-49de-8926-df735cc3a9e7",{"variation":429,"version":17,"items":430,"primary":431,"id":473,"slice_type":474,"slice_label":33},"fullWidthBanner",[],{"theme":21,"show_premium_logo":49,"label":33,"label_theme":432,"titleH2":433,"bodyText":434,"image":464,"rightImage":307,"buttonText":33,"buttonLink":471,"buttonDataGtmTrack":33,"primary_button_external":49,"button_secondary":472,"secondary_button_external":49},"Core","An outstanding service for your recipients",[435,438,441,444,453,456],{"type":25,"text":436,"spans":437,"direction":72},"Your customers can enjoy all these for FREE with our parcel delivery service:",[],{"type":77,"text":439,"spans":440,"direction":72},"End-to-end tracking, with regular updates",[],{"type":77,"text":442,"spans":443,"direction":72},"1-hour delivery window",[],{"type":77,"text":445,"spans":446,"direction":72},"Customers not in? They can divert parcels and collect when it suits them",[447,452],{"start":448,"end":449,"type":103,"data":450},27,41,{"link_type":30,"url":451,"target":106},"\u002Fguides\u002Fdivert-your-parcel",{"start":448,"end":449,"type":108},{"type":77,"text":454,"spans":455,"direction":72},"Photo confirmation of delivery for peace of mind",[],{"type":77,"text":457,"spans":458,"direction":72},"Help centre to support and answer any queries",